## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Step-Through Mode & Speed Control

#### [MODIFY] [demonstration-engine.ts](file:///d:/Projects/PrismRefraction/src/core/runtime/demonstration-engine.ts)

1. Add `playbackMode: "auto" | "step-through"` to `DemoState`
2. Add `advanceStep()` method that resolves a pending promise (like pause/resume pattern)
3. In `runDemo()`, when in step-through mode, wait for `advanceStep()` between each step instead of `delay(speedMs)`
4. Increase default `speedMs` from 3000 to 6000
5. For agent/tool actions, use `Math.max(5000, speedMs)` pacing
6. Add step output capture — `DemoLogEntry.output` already exists but is never broadcast

