1. Add "Auto | Step-Through" toggle to the prompt UI
2. Add "▶ Next Step" button visible in step-through mode
3. Wire Next Step to `POST /api/demo/advance`
4. Add speed slider (500ms – 10000ms range)
5. Display step output (tool results, screenshots) in a collapsible output panel below the narration

